msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-and-paste-text.rst:62
#: 31e0ed40bed14b4a992f1e1b739bcde5
msgid ""
"You can also change them using :doc:`qvm-features <core-admin-client:"
"manpages/qvm-features>`. The following commands would change the *copy/paste "
"to global clipboard* shortcuts to :kbd:`Win` + :kbd:`c` for copy, and :kbd:"
"`Win` + :kbd:`v` for paste:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-and-paste-text.rst:70
#: 98474f28fae94219b5a36a231a47ced4
msgid ""
"For the changes to take effect in a qube, you need to restart the qube after "
"changing the shortcuts."
msgstr ""
